---
import ServiceSidebar from '@/components/services/ServiceSidebar.astro';
---

<section id="content" class="bg-white py-14 lg:py-18" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:root">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:grid">
      
      <!-- Main Content Column -->
      <main class="lg:col-span-8" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:main">
        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-6 leading-[1.2]" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:eu75u3">
          Chapter 13 Bankruptcy in Utah
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-8" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:b3gkwz">
          Chapter 13 Bankruptcy Attorneys serving Salt Lake City and all of Utah. Call today to discuss your reorganization options with an experienced bankruptcy attorney.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-6 mt-12 leading-[1.2]" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:eu75u2">
          What Is Chapter 13 Bankruptcy?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-8" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:4xuzn9">
          Chapter 13 bankruptcy is a "reorganization" bankruptcy that allows individuals to catch up on secured debt arrears (like overdue mortgage or car payments) and repay some or all unsecured debt through a court-approved repayment plan lasting <strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">3–5 years</strong>. At the end of the plan, remaining eligible debts are discharged.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-6 mt-12 leading-[1.2]" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:eu75u1">
          Advantages of Chapter 13 Over Chapter 7
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-8 text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] space-y-3">
          <li data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:x2ishd"><strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">Save your home:</strong> Chapter 13 allows you to cure mortgage arrears over the life of the plan, preventing foreclosure</li>
          <li data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:x2ishc"><strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">Keep non-exempt assets:</strong> Unlike Chapter 7, you generally keep all your property in Chapter 13</li>
          <li data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:x2ishb"><strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">Broader discharge:</strong> Some debts that cannot be discharged in Chapter 7 may be dischargeable in Chapter 13</li>
          <li data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:x2isha"><strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">Cramdown provisions:</strong> In some cases, you can reduce the principal owed on secured debts to the value of the collateral</li>
          <li data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:x2ish9"><strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">Co-signer protection:</strong> The automatic stay extends to protect co-debtors on consumer debts in Chapter 13</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-6 mt-12 leading-[1.2]" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:eu75u0">
          Tax Debt in Chapter 13
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-4" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:4xuzn8">
          Chapter 13 has special provisions for tax debt that make it particularly valuable for taxpayers with significant IRS obligations:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-8 text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] space-y-3">
          <li data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:x2ish8">Priority tax debt (recent taxes) must be paid in full through the plan, but you get 3–5 years to do so without additional penalties accruing</li>
          <li data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:x2ish7">Non-priority tax debt (older taxes meeting discharge requirements) can be treated as general unsecured debt and may receive less than full payment</li>
          <li data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:x2ish6">The automatic stay immediately stops IRS collection actions including levies and garnishments</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-6 mt-12 leading-[1.2]" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:eu75tz">
          Contact Us Today
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-8" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:4xuzn7">
          Call Michelle Turpin P.C. at <strong class="text-[#C1272D] font-bold">(801) 685-0552</strong> to schedule a confidential bankruptcy consultation.
        </p>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-200 mt-10 pt-6" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:wwy8oe">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:4xuzn6">This content is provided for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal advice.</p>
        </div>
      </main>

      <!-- Sidebar Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:sidebar-col">
        <div class="sticky top-24" data-ps="src/components/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy/ServiceContent.astro:sidebar-wrap">
          <ServiceSidebar currentPath="/services/chapter-13-bankruptcy" topicTitle="Chapter 13 Bankruptcy" />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
